    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_8",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Almost Made Ya is an R&B song by American duo Ali & Gipp, for the debut album, \"Kinfolk\" (2007). The song samples Brandy's \"Almost Doesn't Count\". The song is about a relationship between a female and a male; LeToya sings that she is \"almost done\" with her man, that \"they\" need improve the relationship, while the men say about the situation they've been passing. The song leaked on April 13, 2007 and officially released (for commercial purposes) on Sunday, June 13, 2007. The song was written by LeToya Luckett, Jermaine Dupri, Ali Vaskabi-Waski-Jones, Cameron Gipp, Shelly Peiken and Guy Roche",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.9999999963161393,
      "temperature": 0.9999999963161393,
      "expanded": false,
      "visit_count": 0,
